Subject: Map SDL_GetClipboardText
Upstream-base: fbe120f5020f8bdcb9cbf5ae28d9859b29781119

Recharged reads a friend code from the clipboard. SDL2 has the same call with
the same result, a string freed with SDL_free; on Switch it is empty.

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b4111ec..070bd39 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -58,6 +58,7 @@ exist.
   the first one with the same name and ids.
 - On Switch, `SDL_GetPreferredLocales` gives the console's language unless
   `SDL_HINT_PREFERRED_LOCALES` is set.
+- `SDL_GetClipboardText` is SDL2's. On Switch, which has no clipboard, it gives an empty string.
 - On Switch, `SDL_GetBasePath` is the folder of the running `.nro`, taken from the `sdmc:/` path the
   Homebrew Menu passes as `argv[0]`. Without such a path it is SDL2's answer, which on Switch is
   none.
